{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.poster.avif?t=1755686058\" aria-label=\"Success_gif\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.webm?t=1755686058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.mp4?t=1755686058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOULD YOU JUMP TO THE SKY\u2026 ON A POGO STICK?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;POGO UP ! &quot;, a vertical adventure where one man, one pogo stick, and a whole lot of poor decisions lead to the ultimate climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a surreal, floating world full of bizarre obstacles, strange structures, and precarious platforms \u2014 all standing between you and the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no map. No checkpoints. Just your pogo stick, physics, and your growing frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall once? Back to the start. Fall again? Well, you're used to it now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your balance, aim your jumps, a bounce your way through a mysterious world suspended in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is he climbing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s at the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And seriously\u2026 why a pogo stick? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.poster.avif?t=1755686058\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.webm?t=1755686058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.mp4?t=1755686058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based pogo jumping \u2014 easy to play, hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum &amp; timing are everything \u2014 balance is key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful soundtrack to contrast your internal screaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No checkpoints, restart only </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features stage-based checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you move, the faster and higher you go \u2014 until you lose control.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bouncy Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891990/35a98bb1a7a8167a13cbade505c884a64dd6f2fa.jpg"},{"name":"Village Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891990/d7bd3bba1a8ca3ac99cd2313a01dbd2bfc8f6d89.jpg"},{"name":"Gym Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891990/b36dfcc44e03ca8b18cca5557d0d299d26ab4c32.jpg"},{"name":"City Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891990/e051a8d3d5c62cbc4eff42966e4e713c96c438fa.jpg"},{"name":"Pogo God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891990/03d0342f377b6cf7c9791278bf2e3213eab6c446.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891990?t=1755686058","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891990?t=1755686058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/aaf4ad4608a2666725d8eb0a081815b7abd88cd1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755686058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/aaf4ad4608a2666725d8eb0a081815b7abd88cd1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755686058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.poster.avif?t=1755686058\" aria-label=\"Success_gif\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.webm?t=1755686058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.mp4?t=1755686058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOULD YOU JUMP TO THE SKY\u2026 ON A POGO STICK?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;POGO UP ! &quot;, a vertical adventure where one man, one pogo stick, and a whole lot of poor decisions lead to the ultimate climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a surreal, floating world full of bizarre obstacles, strange structures, and precarious platforms \u2014 all standing between you and the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no map. No checkpoints. Just your pogo stick, physics, and your growing frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall once? Back to the start. Fall again? Well, you're used to it now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your balance, aim your jumps, a bounce your way through a mysterious world suspended in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is he climbing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s at the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And seriously\u2026 why a pogo stick? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.poster.avif?t=1755686058\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.webm?t=1755686058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.mp4?t=1755686058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based pogo jumping \u2014 easy to play, hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum &amp; timing are everything \u2014 balance is key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful soundtrack to contrast your internal screaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No checkpoints, restart only </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features stage-based checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you move, the faster and higher you go \u2014 until you lose control.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Team MKM"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/1de846d0fb3db800ff082a3bf5112024d197d389/header.jpg?t=1755686058","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<str